{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The search is over. You know this is where you will build it. There is power in these lands, and you will use it as you see fit. Purrgonia will come to life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.poster.avif?t=1759180462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.webm?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.mp4?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new world in <strong>Purrgonia</strong>, a stylized rogue-lite game in which your main goal is to rebuild the village. Dive into dozens of handcrafted locations, randomly arranged for your raid to be exciting each time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make impactful decisions, based on stories left by past travelers, or write your own history. Become an unstoppable force that drives the region to change.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.poster.avif?t=1759180462\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.webm?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.mp4?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything you do matters.</strong> There are several mechanics in the game that affect your gameplay and endings. Some of those you have to figure out on your own!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Design.\u00a0</strong>Enjoy the feel of a fairy tale while traversing through our handcrafted levels. Let the music help, too!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your village.</strong>\u00a0Your villagers need to eat something! Bring them some resources and make them happy. Perhaps, they'll repay the favour!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the adventure with your friends and family.</strong> Online co-op supports up to 16 players, although we recommend 2-4. We're also family-friendly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So many stories!</strong> The world is full of lore. Can you find out what mystery lies behind the magic of these lands?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hero is yours to design!\u00a0</strong>Enjoy customizing your character at any time. Looks and gear both. New game plus is also available!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through enemies.</strong> Weapons, skills, consumables - what more could you want?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring travelers in.</strong> Find and rescue lost friends, and invite them to your tavern. They've got quite a story to tell!\u00a0</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Make Dance not War!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/f94384c0504d2cb6cadf8cb39b7b45cd16aa4177.jpg"},{"name":"Na zdorovye!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/be06a25e0ae268e2c20f34156361022b5797d0c4.jpg"},{"name":"Carrying the team","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/e146bf0b088eefaece78d1d147cbb89d625780d0.jpg"},{"name":"Playing with death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/1986ba2bee9f102b706f462fdabf492a8733e4b1.jpg"},{"name":"Sell me this pen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/e40c71a42da404f138114a8c5aadfa700c7f4f8d.jpg"},{"name":"Fighting the good fight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/4214f31e4cb58008b93ca0694df7a4284133a84d.jpg"},{"name":"The mountains are calling!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/edf1d3ecaa6e6bf16aa4067c80da7ece995a567e.jpg"},{"name":"Dreamland","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/5ca231b31db5ec4c5f7c150fcf3b7a8eb08346c8.jpg"},{"name":"Don't chop down this tree!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/978757f2be0409ed81c50e03a745bbedf65fa858.jpg"},{"name":"I'm back!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2945730/89d918a54b75ce3c3bea46b003e96df1c5ea1242.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945730?t=1759180462","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759180462","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/ceac3814d521bb690eb81446004fae433ba26582/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759180462","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/ceac3814d521bb690eb81446004fae433ba26582/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759180462","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The search is over. You know this is where you will build it. There is power in these lands, and you will use it as you see fit. Purrgonia will come to life!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.poster.avif?t=1759180462\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.webm?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/7463f6bd741694f1471d6b0d1a9cb5a9.mp4?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new world in <strong>Purrgonia</strong>, a stylized rogue-lite game in which your main goal is to rebuild the village. Dive into dozens of handcrafted locations, randomly arranged for your raid to be exciting each time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make impactful decisions, based on stories left by past travelers, or write your own history. Become an unstoppable force that drives the region to change.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.poster.avif?t=1759180462\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.webm?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945730/extras/09534200bfdc72552ff7ee9f01f7c3dc.mp4?t=1759180462\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything you do matters.</strong> There are several mechanics in the game that affect your gameplay and endings. Some of those you have to figure out on your own!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Design.\u00a0</strong>Enjoy the feel of a fairy tale while traversing through our handcrafted levels. Let the music help, too!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your village.</strong>\u00a0Your villagers need to eat something! Bring them some resources and make them happy. Perhaps, they'll repay the favour!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share the adventure with your friends and family.</strong> Online co-op supports up to 16 players, although we recommend 2-4. We're also family-friendly!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So many stories!</strong> The world is full of lore. Can you find out what mystery lies behind the magic of these lands?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The hero is yours to design!\u00a0</strong>Enjoy customizing your character at any time. Looks and gear both. New game plus is also available!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight your way through enemies.</strong> Weapons, skills, consumables - what more could you want?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring travelers in.</strong> Find and rescue lost friends, and invite them to your tavern. They've got quite a story to tell!\u00a0</p></li></ul>","developers":["MedveDUR","StvDEV.PRO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":